0..76 Comment "// Rules that overlap are admitted when their critical pairs join (Knuth and"
77..150 Comment "// Bendix\'s completion; Baader and Nipkow, _Term Rewriting and All That_,"
151..228 Comment "// Cambridge University Press, 1998, § 6.2): zero a unit of addition on both"
229..307 Comment "// sides overlaps the recursion on the first argument at `add(Zero, Zero)` and"
308..385 Comment "// at `add(Succ(m), Zero)`, and both pairs rewrite to one term; associativity"
386..433 Comment "// overlaps itself, and its one pair joins too."
435..500 Comment "/// The naturals with addition, zero stated a unit on both sides."
