1210..1269 Comment "/// A semigroup\'s one law: associativity overlaps itself at"
1270..1343 Comment "/// `mul(mul(mul(a, b), c), d)`, and both ways round reach `mul(a, mul(b,"
1344..1418 Comment "/// mul(c, d)))`. The rewrite at the peak matches the rule\'s `z` against a"
1419..1489 Comment "/// subterm holding the peak\'s own `z`, which stays the peak\'s (#654)."
